## 4. Database Schema

6 PostgreSQL tables are created at startup via [init_conversation_table()](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/db_config.py#15-125):

| Table | Purpose | Key Columns |
|-------|---------|-------------|
| `conversation_memory` | Per-message chat history | `session_id`, `role`, `content`, `created_at` |
| [session_state](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/session_store.py#85-123) | Serialized session state (JSON) | `session_id`, `state_data`, [conversation_summary](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/session_store.py#161-199), `last_tool_used`, `action_pending`, `pending_action_data` |
| [user_profile](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/memory/user_profile.py#23-37) | Extracted user facts | `session_id`, `name`, [email](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/tools/email_tool.py#19-72), `preferred_language`, `timezone` |
| [conversation_summary](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/session_store.py#161-199) | LLM-generated summaries | `session_id`, [summary](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/session_store.py#161-199) |
| `chat_logs` | Analytics-grade logs | `session_id`, `user_id`, `role`, [message](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/session_store.py#50-83), [intent](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/main.py#25-34), `created_at` |

> [!NOTE]
> The `chat_logs` table now includes safe ALTER TABLE migrations for [intent](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/main.py#25-34) and `user_id` columns, handling pre-existing tables that were created before these columns existed (fix applied 2026-03-02).

