## 6. LangGraph State Machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> route_entry
    route_entry --> handle_confirmation: awaiting_confirmation=true
    route_entry --> classify_intent: else
    
    handle_confirmation --> [*]
    
    classify_intent --> normal_chat: intent=normal_chat
    classify_intent --> schedule_meeting: intent=schedule_meeting
    classify_intent --> email_flow: intent=send_email/send_email_only
    classify_intent --> normal_chat: intent=missing_information
    classify_intent --> email_flow: intent=confirmation_reply
    
    normal_chat --> [*]
    schedule_meeting --> [*]
    email_flow --> [*]
```

**Valid Intents:** [schedule_meeting](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/nodes.py#385-512), [send_email](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/tools/email_tool.py#19-72), `send_email_only`, `missing_information`, [normal_chat](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/nodes.py#622-740), `confirmation_reply`

