| 1 | `column "intent" does not exist` in `chat_logs` | Table created before [intent](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/main.py#25-34) column was added | Safe ALTER TABLE migration in [db_config.py](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/db_config.py) |
| 2 | Logging failure interrupting response flow | [log_chat()](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/tools/chat_logger.py#15-63) exceptions could propagate | Double try/except (in [chat_logger.py](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/tools/chat_logger.py) + [app.py](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/app.py)), print debug |
| 3 | Fallback greeting returned repeatedly | Unclear response flow in `/chat` endpoint | Explicit 4-step flow: generate → debug → log → return |
| 4 | Insufficient debug visibility | No console-visible diagnostics | Added `print()` across 5 files: [app.py](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/app.py), [nodes.py](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/nodes.py), [main.py](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/main.py), [chat_logger.py](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/tools/chat_logger.py) |

